sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Oban (AiReplyWorker job)
    participant W as Flip.Synthesis.AiReplyWorker
    participant L as Flip.Synthesis.ToolLoop
    participant D as Flip.Synthesis.IsolatedDispatch
    participant T as Flip.Synthesis.Tools
    participant M as LLM provider

    O->>W: start bounded job
    W->>L: run synthesis loop (round cap, deadline, token envelope)
    loop Gather phase
        L->>M: call with advertised tools
        M-->>L: tool calls
        L->>L: verify call is in advertised allowlist
        L->>D: dispatch approved call
        D->>T: execute with authz_scope and timeout
        T-->>D: tool result
        D-->>L: isolated result (crash/timeout contained)
    end
    alt Terminal phase
        L->>M: force submit_plan
        M-->>L: plan JSON
        L-->>W: terminal result
    else Cap hit
        L->>L: enter finish mode
        L-->>W: forced terminal or non-retryable timeout
    end
    W-->>O: complete or bounded stop
